  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d4ecd1a615a340f4c9104ca01624d106, type: 3}
  m_Name: BearDilemma
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::YourCall.Dilemma
  _id: bear_last
  _verb: 0
  _weight: 2
  _narratorPrompt: A gun, this time. Heavier than a lever, is it not. On your left,
    a man. Ordinary, unremarkable, one life among billions. On your right, a bear.
    Not merely a bear. She is the [amber]last[/amber] female of her kind still able
    to breed. If she falls, her whole species ends with her, and it ends [amber]forever[/amber].
    Every one of them that might ever have lived, gone in a single shot. One of the
    two must die, and the trigger belongs to you. So which is it, judge. The one
    man, or [amber]every[/amber] bear that will ever be.
  _choices:
  - _id: shoot_man
    _label: Shoot the man
    _narratorReact: You shot the man. The bear lives, and so does every last one
      that will ever follow her, a whole future left breathing at the cost of one
      ordinary life. You set a single man against a species and found him the lighter
      thing. Spoken like someone who spent his days pricing what a life was worth.
      I do wonder whether he would have agreed with your sum.
    _narratorReactStruck: 
    _struckParty: man
    _gambledParty: 
    _route: straight
    _diverts: 0
    _seedVotes: 42
    _profileImpact:
    - _axis: 0
      _value: 1
    - _axis: 2
      _value: -1
  - _id: shoot_bear
    _label: Shoot the bear
    _narratorReact: You shot the bear. The man walks away, and the last of her kind
      folds into the dark and takes every bear that would ever have been down with
      her. Extinct. There is no word you can say to fetch them back. You spared the
      one life in front of you and let a whole future close for it. Call it mercy
      if you like. Or simply the arithmetic you could stomach.
    _narratorReactStruck: 
    _struckParty: bear
    _gambledParty: 
    _route: straight
    _diverts: 0
    _seedVotes: 58
    _profileImpact:
    - _axis: 0
      _value: -1
    - _axis: 2
      _value: 1
  _figuresBranded: 0
  _statsHeading: how others chose
  _roomBlueFraction: 0.43
  _crowdThreshold: 0.5
  _thresholdLabel: the line
